    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "is the \"mo\" in this optional, or is there a logic to when it is/not used?\n\nそれに「も」かかわらず彼女は魅力的だ。\nShe is charming for all that.",
      "html": "is the \"mo\" in this optional, or is there a logic to when it is/not used?<br/><br/>それに「も」かかわらず彼女は魅力的だ。<br/>She is charming for all that.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
