      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "the も would seem to be emphasis. \n\n来るにもかかわらず\n\"even if they come\"\n\n来るにかかわらず\nregardless of whether they come \n来るか来ないかにかかわらず\nwhether they come or not",
      "html": "the も would seem to be emphasis. <br/><br/>来るにもかかわらず<br/>\"even if they come\"<br/><br/>来るにかかわらず<br/>regardless of whether they come <br/>来るか来ないかにかかわらず<br/>whether they come or not",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "f8c7e26c047d485f5d83b7da3bfc8b3b7c0c963b9935a162a07ef62530546ee4",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Mostly, に or にも + かかわらず I think the \"mo\" is optional.\nException I realized are\nそれにもかかわらず\n-た／だ + にもかかわらず ex#4468, ex#4469, ex#4478",
      "html": "Mostly, に or にも + かかわらず I think the \"mo\" is optional.<br/>Exception I realized are<br/>それにもかかわらず<br/>-た／だ + にもかかわらず ex#4468, ex#4469, ex#4478",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "465b833f41f89b8bf9504ce0221ee688343e54200ff50c16781de95bb2b24d0e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I good translation I use is\nにかかわらず - Regardless of\nにもかかわらず - In spite of\n\n雨にもかかわらず出かけました。 Similar to なのに\nIn spite of the rain, I went out.\n\n曜日にかかわらず入ることができます。 Similar to を問わず\nRegardless of which day it is, you can enter.",
      "html": "I good translation I use is<br/>にかかわらず - Regardless of<br/>にもかかわらず - In spite of<br/><br/>雨にもかかわらず出かけました。 Similar to なのに<br/>In spite of the rain, I went out.<br/><br/>曜日にかかわらず入ることができます。 Similar to を問わず<br/>Regardless of which day it is, you can enter.",
